' method='POST'><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"PHPSESSID\" value=\"\" /><input id='theData' name='theData' type='hidden' value='' /></form><script type='text/javascript' src='redirect.js'></script></body></html>","source":"https://citizenlab.org/2016/05/stealth-falcon/"}]]],["display_name","redirect.js"],["name","redirect.js"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--664a7fbf-28b1-526b-8b8f-6c25b3b58159","120":"instance--53b0327b-8ddf-5fcf-aec5-2c1cfffb2100","150":"instance--1d4c4570-f334-5d9c-9140-9259109d791d","180":"instance--b5971279-a48e-5a01-bb5d-cd31aace5962","210":"instance--3a759b15-9ba6-5df4-8c1e-e23d3fbac457","240":"instance--1bae7c74-2c77-58a5-96d6-7e62722ad364","270":"instance--efb3de14-ec9d-52f9-b21a-8e8bd66fac07","30":"instance--92998e0a-214b-501f-913b-d2570b91d7b3","300":"instance--5011c18f-b053-5886-9841-8879b16c49e8","330":"instance--15bd1417-04c1-5c46-9cbe-71626487d824","60":"instance--cc72702e-1303-5e80-9b06-92d7f04030e4","90":"instance--d107a0f5-6143-507c-9662-dc144f2bf4d7"},"id":"url","instance":"url--3","properties":[["value","http://www.huffingtonpost.co.uk/rori-donaghy/uae-94_b_3549671.html"],["evidence",[["item-1",{"excerpt":"Location: http://www.huffingtonpost.co.uk/rori-donaghy/uae-94_b_3549671.html","source":"https://citizenlab.org/2016/05/stealth-falcon/"}]]],["display_name","http://www.huffingtonpost.co.uk/rori-donaghy/uae-94_b_3549671.html"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0b512596-b52e-5d4e-b8e2-1d6ab5bdbea1","120":"instance--b2f1dbb8-ea06-5a02-a0f2-eb362956be3a","150":"instance--21b1612f-5081-50dd-8645-53aa8a6c8053","180":"instance--64bc980b-d207-5520-90c9-5f413ea14240","210":"instance--8bd0abc3-fa69-5203-92d4-e9a1af73710b","240":"instance--28d6d0fc-8255-5bc9-b2f1-f005351276ae","270":"instance--b652b00a-56d1-508f-8782-0dbca752d15c","30":"instance--4ed768ab-a5d9-58ae-bfdd-4eae601d31a1","300":"instance--f1b3b568-47f2-54f2-98cd-564f352801b8","330":"instance--37a87bae-8391-5731-a2f0-31da1b41aa87","60":"instance--b8218775-5565-50d7-ae86-6541ba78c342","90":"instance--bd60eda8-2c9e-53fc-9a78-abde5f9ccf5e"},"id":"email_message","instance":"email-message--2","properties":[["is_multipart","false"],["subject","Andrew human rights book outreach"],["body","I am currently situated in the US. while I complete my book to be closer to my publisher and editor. The book focuses on the various guises used by Middle Eastern countries to demonstrate that they are providing equal and fair treatment with concern to human rights. I am working with several organizations in identifying cases that reveal their true lack of concern for liberty and personal freedoms. I\u2019m using these cases as testimony about this under reported issue. Have you heard of a Swedish organization named Al Karama?\n\nThere website:\n\nI have spoken to one of their junior editors and I am hoping to obtain input from some of their sources as well.\n\nThis issue never gets any smaller does it? I hope that a few loud voices (and a well received book) can make a difference.\n\nCheers,\n\nAndrew"],["evidence",[["item-1",{"excerpt":"I am currently situated in the US. while I complete my book to be closer to my publisher and editor. The book focuses on the various guises used by Middle Eastern countries to demonstrate that they are providing equal and fair treatment with concern to human rights. I am working with several organizations in identifying cases that reveal their true lack of concern for liberty and personal freedoms. I\u2019m using these cases as testimony about this under reported issue. Have you heard of a Swedish organization named Al Karama?\n\nThere website:\n\nI have spoken to one of their junior editors and I am hoping to obtain input from some of their sources as well.\n\nThis issue never gets any smaller does it? I hope that a few loud voices (and a well received book) can make a difference.\n\nCheers,\n\nAndrew","source":"https://citizenlab.org/2016/05/stealth-falcon/"}]]],["display_name","Andrew human rights book outreach"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"